  "purpose": "Distribution recipes for omc (Nix flake, Guix channel, Arch Linux ARM PKGBUILD, Debian .deb, GHCR image) that all birth omc from omega-mv's 408-byte seed with seed/omega-from-seed.sh at the pinned commit and refuse any omc whose sha256 differs from pins.env; release workflow publishes attested .deb, bare binary, SPDX SBOM and SHA256SUMS.",
